   this migration (ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS, ALTER COLUMN SET/DROP NOT NULL,
   SET DEFAULT, UPDATE, CREATE [UNIQUE] INDEX IF NOT EXISTS) is invariant across
   11-17, and NULLS DISTINCT has been the unique-index default since long before
   15 made NULLS NOT DISTINCT an option — but the 17.6 run is CI's
   `migrations` job on the pull request, not this script.

